{"name":"Ironstone","hex":"#865040","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"ironstone","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Any ore of iron which is impure through the admixture of silica or clay.","A type of vitreous pottery similar to stoneware."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/ironstone"}],"entries":[{"title":"Ironstone","blocks":[{"text":"Ironstone is a sedimentary rock, either deposited directly as a ferruginous sediment or created by chemical replacement, that contains a substantial proportion of an iron ore compound from which iron (Fe) can be smelted commercially."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/76/Ironstone_Breathitt.jpg/330px-Ironstone_Breathitt.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ironstone","wikidata":"Q2509719"},{"title":"Ironstone (band)","blocks":[{"text":"Ironstone are an Australian progressive deathcore band, which formed in Bendigo in 2016. As from 2026 they comprise founding lead vocalist and main songwriter Edward Warren, and his brother Perry Warren on guitar, who have been joined by Samuel Angove on bass guitar, Remy Giuliani on guitar and Jackson Whyte on drums. The band have independently released three extended plays (EPs), Prophecy (2020), The Place I Cannot Find (2022) and A Shadow of My Former Self (2025)."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ironstone_(band)","wikidata":"Q140043036"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2b/Iron-cemented_sandstone.jpg/500px-Iron-cemented_sandstone.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2b/Iron-cemented_sandstone.jpg/1280px-Iron-cemented_sandstone.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2b/Iron-cemented_sandstone.jpg/500px-Iron-